# Overview

Rocci lets you write HTML in Roc, run a small app from `.rocci` files,
and optionally publish Markdown on that same stack. This manual is for
a programmer who can use a terminal.

Preview a component, or run a standalone app. Rocdown documents are
optional and experimental.

A component looks like this:

```rocci
import Html

@component
Hello = |{ name }|
    <p>Hello, <strong>{name}</strong></p>
```

macOS and Linux development are tested in CI. There is no crates.io
package or installer yet; [build from this repository](/docs/install/).

